<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>This world fills my heart not with pleasure,</l><l>But hunger and much anxious care.</l><l>What joy, in the midst of my suff’ring,</l><l>My Christ came and saved me from there.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>At first I was fearful and fled Him,</l><l>Why would He seek someone like me?</l><l>But calling my name, He disarmed me,</l><l>His voice warm, compassionate, sweet.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>It’s here I forget my condition,</l><l>And failure my standard to meet.</l><l>I see only Christ in His richness,</l><l>And worship my Lord at His feast!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
